{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215210","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1421521001:0":{"text":"여긴 시끄럽네요... 무슨 일이죠?","source_cn":"怎么这里在吵架呀……发生什么了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB388FC0A34846B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421521002:1":{"text":"진행자가 내가 대회 규칙을 위반했다며... 내 참가 자격을 박탈했어!","source_cn":"这个主持人说我违反了比赛规则……我的参赛资格被取消了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x589A05AF0B2EA2E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421521003:1":{"text":"조사해 보니, 우리가 제공한 게 아니라 본인이 준비한 양질의 정철을 사용한 걸로 밝혀졌어요...","source_cn":"经过调查，你使用的材料确实不是我们提供的，而是自己准备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF477B93519571B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421521004:1":{"text":"좋은 재료를 쓴 게 뭐가 어때서! 당신들이 말한 합격 기준을 충족하기 위해서잖아! 당신들이 준 재료로 대체 뭘 만들 수 있는데?!","source_cn":"我用点好材料有什么不对！还不是为了达到你们说的合格标准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF849C4F5C1ED1369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421521005:1":{"text":"하지만 이건 규칙입니다...","source_cn":"可我们制定了规则……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9398F7C1EE8C55D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421521006:1":{"text":"당신들이 정한 규칙은 정말 비합리적이야! 내가 대회를 주최하는 게 낫겠어!","source_cn":"你们定的规则根本就不合理！这比赛不如换我来办！……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x307EECCBD95E8669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠卡尔林":{"text":"장인 칼린","source":"工匠卡尔林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:锻魂大赛主持人":{"text":"제련 대회 진행자","source":"锻魂大赛主持人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}